OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow      
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few light  
OL,6,Fshowers in southwest, the north of     
OL,7,FScotland and for Irish Sea coasts.     
OL,8,FVery cold for most with a sharp frost  
OL,9,Fdeveloping, severe in places, but      
OL,10,Fmilder in the far southwest. Some      
OL,11,Fpatches of mist and freezing fog.      
OL,13,CSaturday:FFog lifting to bring long    
OL,14,Fspells of autumn sunshine in the       
OL,15,Fnorth, but cloudy intervals further    
OL,16,Fsouth and over Northern Ireland.       
OL,17,FBecoming breezy in the west this       
OL,18,Fevening. Feeling cold.                 
